    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0000125 -->

    <Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0000125">
        <rdfs:label>mass</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0001241"/>
        <ns3:IAO_0000115>A physical quality that inheres in a bearer by virtue of the proportion of the bearer&#39;s amount of matter.</ns3:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:comment>For any biological use of PATO, the concept that should be used is &#39;mass&#39; and not &#39;weight&#39;. For example, increased weight of an organism.</rdfs:comment>
